 rticipants can register for the full marathon\, half marathon\, 10K\, or K
 ids Kilo events.[](https://www.visitarizona.com/events/%20https:/flagstaff
 marathon.com/)\n\nEvent website: https://flagstaffmarathon.com/\n\nVisit A
