UID:0a22ee6607dacf7754bc98e2@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The race recognizes and celebrates the history of the Mother R
 oad. From the Bunion Derbies\; “Oakie’s” during the Dust Bowl\; the 
 boom years of family road trips after WWII\; decline after the interstate 
 system bypassed mom- and-pop motels\, restaurants\, and shops\; to grassro
 ots resurgence leading to official recognition that Route 66 had “become
  a symbol of the American people’s heritage of travel and their legacy o
 f seeking a better life.” Options are available for a fast solo runner\,
  a team player or even a walker. Individual runners or relay teams Route 6
 6 Centennial Certified Event 140 Miles of History\n\nEvent website: https:
 //route66ultrarun.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.
 com/events/route-66-ultrarun
